# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore file: applies when building with
# `docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .` (repo-root context, the CI shape),
# taking precedence over any <context>/.dockerignore. Patterns are relative
# to the CONTEXT (repo root). Keeps host node_modules/.next from clobbering
# the image's `npm ci` output and shrinks the context upload.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
**/.venv
.git
.worktrees
data
dist
docs
infra
libs
scripts
apps/collector
